  "description": "The 700c Kent GZR 700 is perfect for anyone looking for a fast & durable road bike. This bike is built with a tig-welded steel frame and fork that can withstand daily rides. With a 21 speed drivetrain and classic road style stem shifters, the Kent GZR 700 is built to conquer any hill or straightaway with ease. And with front and rear alloy dual pivot caliper brakes, you can trust that your stopping power will always be reliable. The lightweight alloy wheels and 700c x 32c road tires make this bike perfect for long-distance riding, and the height adjustable seat post allows you to customize your riding experience to your exact specifications. This bike is not only built for performance - it also boasts a striking blazing orange gloss finish that is sure to turn heads wherever you go. If you're looking for a road bike that is built to last, and looks amazing doing it, then the 700c Kent GZR 700 is the bike for you.",
